WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:04.570
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.570 --> 00:08.200
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.200 --> 00:16.130
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.280 --> 00:27.790
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.790 --> 00:33.730
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.730 --> 00:42.670
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.670 --> 00:47.440
Kaze no you ni

00:47.440 --> 00:50.510
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.510 --> 00:54.120
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.120 --> 01:00.560
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.560 --> 01:07.360
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.360 --> 01:13.470
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.470 --> 01:20.210
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.210 --> 01:27.440
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:46.430 --> 01:48.140
No...

01:48.140 --> 01:49.840
It's the usual examination.

01:49.840 --> 01:51.810
Nothing to be scared of.

01:51.810 --> 01:54.480
I've never made it hurt, either, have I?

01:54.480 --> 01:56.310
No...

02:01.750 --> 02:04.590
You seem to be in a foul mood.

02:04.590 --> 02:05.850
Rosenberg.

02:05.850 --> 02:09.880
Did she refuse to comply
with the examination again?

02:15.460 --> 02:16.760
What's this?

02:16.760 --> 02:20.600
Today is Thanksgiving. A day for giving thanks.

02:20.600 --> 02:24.170
Or would you have preferred a turkey?

02:24.170 --> 02:26.810
I have no interest in pandering to social norms.

02:26.810 --> 02:31.510
That response is very like you,
Dr. Heinz Schneider.

02:31.510 --> 02:34.580
But that is why I placed her in your care.

02:34.580 --> 02:37.220
I will conduct the
examination within a day or two.

02:37.220 --> 02:39.420
Will you be all right?

02:39.420 --> 02:41.220
This is the third...

02:41.220 --> 02:44.660
No, the fourth time, isn't it?
That she's refused the examination?

02:44.660 --> 02:46.930
That subject has a will of its own.

02:46.930 --> 02:49.260
It cannot be manipulated as I see fit.

02:49.260 --> 02:52.600
Then, here.

02:52.600 --> 02:54.330
Use this.

02:56.600 --> 02:59.730
Fight heart with heart.

03:05.180 --> 03:07.810
Now, shall we begin?

03:09.920 --> 03:11.610
Ellis?

03:20.960 --> 03:24.230
"Man's destiny is within himself."
"Man's destiny is within himself."

03:24.230 --> 03:25.430
"Man's destiny is within himself."
"Jean-Paul Sartre"
"Man's destiny is within himself."

03:25.430 --> 03:26.370
"Man's destiny is within himself."
"Jean-Paul Sartre"

04:26.860 --> 04:29.330
I like that one the best.

04:32.630 --> 04:34.340
Ellis...

04:34.340 --> 04:36.040
Sorry for entering without permission.

04:36.040 --> 04:38.870
It doesn't really bother me.

04:43.910 --> 04:45.650
It's done.

04:45.650 --> 04:47.050
What?

04:55.020 --> 04:58.490
- You.
- What?

04:58.490 --> 05:01.520
It doesn't look like you, but it's you.

05:07.740 --> 05:09.800
Ellis, go get changed.

05:09.800 --> 05:11.910
Your hands and feet must be cold.

05:11.910 --> 05:14.580
I'll go stoke the fire in the fireplace,

05:14.580 --> 05:17.070
so come to the living room after you've changed.

05:19.510 --> 05:22.850
- Quickly.
- Okay, got it.

05:34.560 --> 05:36.760
How are you doing?

05:36.760 --> 05:38.070
With what?

05:38.070 --> 05:40.570
Are you warmed up?

05:40.570 --> 05:43.940
- Yes.
- I see.

05:43.940 --> 05:45.670
Why?

05:58.990 --> 05:59.050
"Time does not exist.
There is only the current moment."

05:59.050 --> 06:03.060
"Time does not exist.
There is only the current moment."
"Time does not exist.
There is only the current moment."

06:03.060 --> 06:03.930
"Time does not exist.
There is only the current moment."
"Lev Nikolayevich Tolstoy"
"Time does not exist.
There is only the current moment."

06:03.930 --> 06:05.360
"Time does not exist.
There is only the current moment."
"Lev Nikolayevich Tolstoy"

06:18.110 --> 06:20.810
Hello.

06:20.810 --> 06:23.140
I looked through the report.

06:23.140 --> 06:25.510
We have a problem.

06:25.510 --> 06:28.050
Ellis has shown no change of late.

06:28.050 --> 06:29.480
So?

06:29.480 --> 06:33.590
My job is to periodically collect data on her,

06:33.590 --> 06:36.690
analyze it, and report the results to you.

06:36.690 --> 06:40.930
I can't help you if you come
to me about changes and such.

06:40.930 --> 06:43.060
"Her"?

06:43.060 --> 06:45.800
You just referred to Ellis as "her."

06:45.800 --> 06:48.870
Yes, something wrong with that?

06:48.870 --> 06:51.440
No, not really.

06:51.440 --> 06:54.740
Just thinking, oh, how people change.

06:54.740 --> 06:57.010
What are you talking about?

06:57.010 --> 06:58.850
"The subject."

06:58.850 --> 07:02.150
That is what you used to refer to Ellis as.

07:02.150 --> 07:08.820
At the time, I thought it was so
like you to refer to her as such.

07:08.820 --> 07:10.730
What happened?

07:10.730 --> 07:12.820
Did you have a change of heart?

07:14.200 --> 07:15.630
Who knows?

07:15.630 --> 07:17.770
You must pardon me.

07:17.770 --> 07:20.640
It seems my curiosity got the better of me.

07:20.640 --> 07:24.510
Things that concern oneself can be
surprisingly mysterious to oneself.

07:24.510 --> 07:29.010
More importantly, as of this year,
Ellis will have been here for ten years.

07:29.010 --> 07:32.050
Judging by the analysis results thus far,

07:32.050 --> 07:36.620
perhaps she's the same as the others, after all.

07:36.620 --> 07:40.520
As in, not a witch?

07:40.520 --> 07:44.590
She has superior physical abilities
compared to normal humans

07:44.590 --> 07:45.930
and while minute,

07:45.930 --> 07:48.660
I have occasionally detected
unique emanations from her...

07:50.060 --> 07:53.800
But she's never actually gone so far
as to cause something to happen.

07:56.800 --> 07:59.470
Welcome back.

07:59.470 --> 08:01.880
Never mind "Maxwell's demon,"

08:01.880 --> 08:04.680
she hasn't even shown enough
supernatural power to bend a spoon.

08:04.680 --> 08:06.650
That may be yet to come.

08:06.650 --> 08:09.950
I do not think so.

08:09.950 --> 08:12.550
Do you wish to part with Ellis?

08:12.550 --> 08:17.120
Once the study is over, there will
be no reason for her to be here.

08:17.120 --> 08:19.590
And you are fine with that?

08:19.590 --> 08:21.160
What do you mean?

08:21.160 --> 08:22.830
How should I put this?

08:22.830 --> 08:26.970
It seems as though you are running
away from your own feelings, Doctor.

08:26.970 --> 08:29.240
I don't understand what you mean.

08:29.240 --> 08:31.100
I imagine not.

08:32.810 --> 08:34.510
Please leave.

08:34.510 --> 08:38.240
I still haven't finished a paper
I have to submit to a conference.

08:40.210 --> 08:42.150
I will be on my way, then.

08:42.150 --> 08:45.080
I will discuss the matter
of Ellis with my superiors.

09:00.100 --> 09:05.870
Since it seems light has begun
to shine in on the darkness...

09:05.870 --> 09:07.900
...just a little...

09:12.710 --> 09:15.710
Ellis, want some coffee?

09:19.750 --> 09:21.550
Ellis?

09:24.330 --> 09:26.960
Ellis, that's...

09:26.960 --> 09:29.930
He went missing, so I looked for him...

09:29.930 --> 09:33.300
And... I found him here...

09:33.300 --> 09:35.040
Who did it?

09:35.040 --> 09:37.070
It wasn't me.

09:37.070 --> 09:40.780
He was my favorite...

09:40.780 --> 09:42.710
Did Rosenberg do this?

09:42.710 --> 09:45.310
But why?

09:45.310 --> 09:47.280
It's awful...

09:52.790 --> 09:54.350
Ellis?

09:57.960 --> 09:59.650
Ellis?!

10:11.940 --> 10:13.670
Ellis, stop this!

10:13.670 --> 10:16.210
Ellis!

10:16.210 --> 10:18.200
Stop this now, Ellis!

10:44.340 --> 10:47.100
A beautiful sunset...

10:57.320 --> 11:00.860
So it was true...

11:00.860 --> 11:03.190
"Demons" really do exist...

11:06.260 --> 11:08.060
But...

11:24.250 --> 11:25.010
"Self-discovery comes when a man
measures himself against an obstacle."

11:25.010 --> 11:29.050
"Self-discovery comes when a man
measures himself against an obstacle."
"Self-discovery comes when a man
measures himself against an obstacle."

11:29.050 --> 11:29.680
"Self-discovery comes when a man
measures himself against an obstacle."
"Antoine Saint-Exupéry"
"Self-discovery comes when a man
measures himself against an obstacle."

11:29.680 --> 11:30.950
"Self-discovery comes when a man
measures himself against an obstacle."
"Antoine Saint-Exupéry"

12:00.410 --> 12:02.280
That's good, Ellis.

12:02.280 --> 12:07.280
In this last month, you've dramatically
reduced your time to activation.

12:24.210 --> 12:26.810
Is this data real?

12:26.810 --> 12:30.040
Facts are facts, whether
they are to your liking or not.

12:30.040 --> 12:31.880
It's strange.

12:31.880 --> 12:34.150
The data for these past three months

12:34.150 --> 12:38.080
is exactly the same as the data
from the same period last year.

12:40.920 --> 12:44.760
Doctor, this study is being paid for
by precious taxpayers' money.

12:44.760 --> 12:46.960
This sort of conduct is unacceptable.

12:46.960 --> 12:48.930
It's useless to try to bait me.

12:48.930 --> 12:51.830
I have not fabricated any of the data.

12:51.830 --> 12:55.790
- Truly?
- If you want to fire me, go ahead.

13:02.510 --> 13:05.510
I see. Then I shall believe you.

13:05.510 --> 13:08.950
By the way, it's a fine day outside.

13:08.950 --> 13:12.390
Why not go on an excursion
out to the lake for once?

13:12.390 --> 13:14.920
I'm sure Ellis would like to go outside as well.

13:14.920 --> 13:17.390
I have no intention of taking the subject out.

13:17.390 --> 13:20.330
Have you forgotten about the
Cartagena Protocol on Biosafety?

13:20.330 --> 13:22.560
"The subject"?

13:22.560 --> 13:24.330
If there is nothing else...

13:24.330 --> 13:27.100
Yes, please excuse me.

13:33.340 --> 13:37.210
Keeping her all to yourself, are you, Doctor?

13:37.210 --> 13:39.200
You will regret it.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.850
Are you all right?

13:52.230 --> 13:54.600
It's so high up.

13:54.600 --> 13:57.600
The sky. It's really high up there.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.260
Oh...

14:08.910 --> 14:11.900
Want to try... going out?

14:34.170 --> 14:36.040
It's big.

14:36.040 --> 14:38.240
Yes, it is.

14:38.240 --> 14:43.910
This lake has a surface area
of 28,568 square kilometers.

14:43.910 --> 14:46.470
It's tenth largest in the world...

14:50.580 --> 14:53.580
I suppose none of that matters.

14:55.020 --> 14:57.320
Waves...

14:57.320 --> 14:59.020
Yes.

15:00.460 --> 15:02.400
Pretty, isn't it?

15:04.570 --> 15:06.260
Yes.

15:08.370 --> 15:10.270
It's cold...

15:12.210 --> 15:14.480
Ellis...

15:14.480 --> 15:18.170
Look, it's cold, Doctor.

16:00.490 --> 16:03.290
- Are you tired?
- I'm okay.

16:03.290 --> 16:06.030
It was a day full of firsts, after all.

16:06.030 --> 16:08.300
- Yes.
- Did you have fun?

16:08.300 --> 16:10.200
Yes.

16:10.200 --> 16:15.340
Get some sleep. There's still the
examination to do when we get back.

16:15.340 --> 16:18.310
So, we are doing the examination...

16:20.310 --> 16:21.970
Yes...

16:34.250 --> 16:34.490
"In love, there is only one law. That is
to bring happiness to the one you love."

16:34.490 --> 16:37.760
