Bread only, huh?

17:19.530 --> 17:22.370
- Morning.
- Ah, morning.

17:22.370 --> 17:24.370
I see you got things ready.

17:24.370 --> 17:27.510
I'll make some soup now, so wait for a bit.

17:27.510 --> 17:30.070
Okay, got it.

17:39.090 --> 17:42.460
- Ellis! Ellis, calm down!
- No! No, no!

17:42.460 --> 17:46.390
- Ellis! Ellis, please don't struggle.
- No!

17:46.390 --> 17:49.660
I don't wanna. I don't wanna do that anymore!

17:49.660 --> 17:51.320
Ellis...

17:54.170 --> 17:55.690
I don't wanna.

17:59.140 --> 18:03.180
All right. No more examinations.

18:03.180 --> 18:06.810
We'll never do another one again. I promise.

18:11.150 --> 18:13.680
I promise you, Ellis.

18:16.390 --> 18:17.860
Ellis...

18:17.860 --> 18:20.560
Promise?

18:20.560 --> 18:23.220
Yes, I promise.

18:28.100 --> 18:29.830
Doctor...

18:33.210 --> 18:35.340
"Life is not complex. We are complex.

18:35.340 --> 18:36.180
"Life is not complex. We are complex.
"Life is not complex. We are complex.

