18:46.890 --> 18:48.790
Is this about right?

18:48.790 --> 18:52.330
I've never roasted a turkey before, after all...

18:52.330 --> 18:54.850
Well, I guess it's fine as
long as it's cooked through.

18:56.760 --> 18:58.700
