18:58.700 --> 19:00.770
Oh, wear whichever one you like better.

19:00.770 --> 19:02.270
I like both.

19:02.270 --> 19:04.440
What? That's a problem.

19:04.440 --> 19:06.840
Then, the one better suited for a party.

19:06.840 --> 19:09.510
A party? We're having a party?

19:09.510 --> 19:11.480
Today is the day for giving thanks, after all.

19:11.480 --> 19:14.250
Thanksgiving? It's the
first time we're doing it.

19:14.250 --> 19:17.420
I suppose. Now, go get changed.

19:17.420 --> 19:18.880
Okay.

19:23.420 --> 19:25.860
There must be a point
where it's perfectly done.

20:11.940 --> 20:13.630
Ellis?

20:16.980 --> 20:18.810
What's the matter?

20:21.750 --> 20:23.650
A present...

20:25.550 --> 20:26.920
For me?

20:26.920 --> 20:29.550
What's this? What are we celebrating?

20:44.570 --> 20:46.470
Ellis...

20:54.250 --> 20:56.310
Because I love you...

21:01.460 --> 21:03.480
Because I love you.

21:09.860 --> 21:12.890
Thank you, Ellis.

21:16.340 --> 21:18.340
I've made up my mind.

21:18.340 --> 21:20.000
Let's leave this place.

21:21.740 --> 21:25.610
We'll go somewhere far away together.

21:25.610 --> 21:27.610
