21:27.610 --> 21:30.910
I'm sure. Nothing else matters now.

21:32.890 --> 21:34.990
Doctor...

21:34.990 --> 21:36.720
Ellis...

22:36.550 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.790
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.790 --> 22:47.690
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.690 --> 22:55.830
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.040 --> 23:05.650
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.650 --> 23:11.450
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.450 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.530
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.530 --> 23:23.530
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.530 --> 23:27.470
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.470 --> 23:33.870
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:33.870 --> 23:37.840
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.840 --> 23:41.180
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.180 --> 23:45.420
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.420 --> 23:51.730
